{"id": "1554117660063826040", "channel_id": "1510911214346305566", "author_id": "1425265631078645841", "author_name": "megane0965_78083", "content": "H1-10\nニムリリカレンアグ\n全戦闘オートチャレンジ\n\nこのパーティはオート適性が高くボスまでは余裕だったがボス戦がオート不可なことを初めて知る\n\n折角なので撃破\n次から気をつける", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T13:08:44.269000+00:00", "thread_id": "1510911214346305566", "attachments": [{"id": "1554117659803787264", "filename": "IMG_9957.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1086097, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1510911214346305566/1554117659803787264/IMG_9957.png?ex=6abbb85c&is=6aba66dc&hm=99f1937491adcc37fa00d53d8c368de9a41188c32209ea19f3ff8fe62358a74b&"}], "thread_title": "ニムフィーアの毒パ研究日誌", "forum_channel_id": "1391703584755941467"}
